# Dev server

When starting the local site (`npm run dev` / Nuxt), always use **network host** mode so it can be opened from a phone on the same Wi‑Fi.

- Prefer `npm run dev` (script already includes `--host`).
- If invoking Nuxt directly: `nuxt dev --host` (never plain `nuxt dev` only).
- After start, tell the user both Local and Network URLs (LAN IP).
